<title>FRANCE: Thomson-CSF 1996 sales up two percent.</title>
<headline>Thomson-CSF 1996 sales up two percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					36,229    vs   35,497</p>
<p>    -- of which fourth quarter		12,537    vs   12,346</p>
<p>NOTE - Thomson-CSF gave the figures in the Balo official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
